&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a Consultative Advisor:&lt;/strong&gt; Become an expert in digital employee experience and internal communication trends, using data and insights to build compelling business cases and challenge prospect assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Internal Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work cross-functionally with Solution Engineers (SEs), Customer Success, and Product teams to ensure seamless discovery, solution scoping, and successful contract closure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
