&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Professional Services Technical Consultant, you will play a technical role in the architecture and successful installation, integration, and deployment of Identity and Access solutions in our clients&#39; environments. You will also assist our implementation partners in that process. You will report to the Director of Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical consulting to our customers and partners from various industries including financial services, manufacturing, government, utilities, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate client business, process, systems, and technology requirements and advise clients on best practices to help guide and solidify proposed designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with clients to assess current problem states, establish desired future states, and make solution recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the detailed solution design, implementation, and delivery of Ping Identity IAM product solutions to our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customers to install, deploy, and configure Ping Identity solutions to meet the customer&#39;s requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Ping Internal teams on escalated customer issues requiring deployment expertise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in services pre-sales processes including presentation of effort size, best practices, and feasibility studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop materials for providing technical consulting (e.g., best practices, report templates, delivery guides, knowledge base articles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help partners ensure they design an architecture aligned to Ping best practices for a successful customer deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and assist in the development of internal and external technical resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical delivery from discovery and design through implementation, testing, production readiness, and handover, coordinating dependencies and surfacing delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and validate secure, scalable, highly available IAM deployments across cloud, hybrid, and on-premises environments, including integration, operational, and disaster-recovery considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex implementation and production issues by analysing logs, traces, configurations, and network behaviour; work with Support and Product Engineering to drive resolution where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute technical validation activities, including integration, end-to-end, performance, and resilience testing, and support cutover and go-live planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear implementation documentation, runbooks, and knowledge-transfer materials so customer and partner teams can operate and support the solution after delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance strong security controls with a seamless user experience when shaping identity journeys and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in a consulting capacity with a minimum of 2 years working directly in the Identity and Access Management space within a large organization or enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a consulting capacity within the Identity and Access Management space, including practical System Integration and Implementation experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A capability-maturity approach to IAM deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with subjects such as TCP/IP networking, OAuth 2.0, SAML 2.0, OIDC, LDAP, and Data Stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Java/JavaScript/Groovy, HTML/CSS to support web application development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in effort estimates and sizing of projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, willing to take initiative, organized, able to work unaccompanied, and manage communications appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in a related field (e.g. Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or Information Systems) or equivalent work-related level of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to travel up to 50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding cross-functional cooperation skills in particular with our Go-To-Market units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience integrating IAM platforms with enterprise directories, applications, APIs, and identity systems, including federation, authentication, and user lifecycle or provisioning flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity standards and protocols such as SCIM, HTTP/REST APIs, and common directory and federation patterns, in addition to OAuth 2.0, SAML 2.0, OIDC, FIDO and LDAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or delivering IAM solutions in cloud, hybrid, or on-premises environments, including deployment, upgrade, resilience, and operational support considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong diagnostic skills across application, identity, and network layers, with experience using logs and traces to isolate and resolve integration issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and carrying out technical testing, production cutovers, and transition to customer or partner operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to facilitate technical discovery and design workshops, explain trade-offs clearly, and adapt recommendations to customer constraints and desired outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within structured delivery practices, including managing technical risks, dependencies, decisions, and changes across a customer engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have an advantage if:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer and Software Security certifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ForgeRock or Ping training badges/certifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills with DevOps best practices, including deployment automation tools, CI/CD, Docker, Terraform, and Kubernetes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Ping Identity products and architectures, such as PingFederate, PingAccess, PingDirectory, PingOne, or PingID.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity governance, privileged access, customer identity, or workforce identity use cases beyond a single IAM product or deployment pattern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability and operational tooling, such as centralised logging, monitoring, alerting, and distributed tracing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with source control, infrastructure-as-code, configuration management, and automated testing for repeatable IAM deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience migrating identity services, applications, or user populations from legacy platforms to modern IAM architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, where you are given the autonomy and support to handle large amounts of responsibility?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you looking for the opportunity to accelerate your sales career whilst also being surrounded by an exceptional entrepreneurial team with motivated and extremely driven people?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for managing and growing a portfolio of sponsors across our international conferences, building long-term relationships with senior decision-makers and driving sponsorship revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-performance B2B sales role with a strong focus on sponsor retention, renewals and account growth, alongside identifying and closing new sponsorship opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a commercially driven salesperson who enjoys building strong client relationships, growing accounts and consistently delivering against revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 2 years of B2B sales experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven track record of achieving or exceeding individual revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing client relationships, retaining customers and identifying opportunities to grow existing accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence engaging, pitching and negotiating with senior decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial instincts and the ability to identify new revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ambition, resilience and ownership – you take responsibility for your portfolio, performance and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;This role might not be the right fit if...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You prefer a role focused purely on relationship management, without responsibility for sales and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t enjoy negotiating, closing deals and working towards commercial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re not comfortable taking ownership of client relationships and proactively identifying opportunities to grow accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re looking for a hybrid or remote position – our London team works together from the office five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and retain sponsors:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong, long-term relationships with an existing portfolio of sponsors, driving renewals and repeat business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow existing accounts:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities to upsell, cross-sell and increase sponsorship revenue within your portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive new business:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, pitch and close new sponsorship opportunities to expand our client base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your revenue targets:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for achieving ambitious individual sales and retention targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver exceptional partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with our content and delivery teams to ensure sponsors receive a high-quality experience and see value in their partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and market-leading OTE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant ownership and responsibility from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The opportunity to work closely with our senior leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International travel to our conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Training, coaching and ongoing development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong opportunities for internal progression as we continue to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;United Media is building a global B2B media and conferences group, bringing together executives, investors, founders and industry leaders through conferences, communities and media brands. Our portfolio spans industries including private equity, insurance, finance, HR and retail, creating opportunities for professionals to connect, learn and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monday–Friday, we work from our &lt;strong&gt;WeWork office in Victoria, London&lt;/strong&gt;. Due to the collaborative nature of our work, we do not offer remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the &lt;strong&gt;right to work in the UK&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Computer Science/Software Engineering or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 + years of experience with Backend Engineering in a high-level programming language (e.g., Java, C#, Golang).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases and message queue technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with continuous integration and deployment (CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or experience with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our expanding R&amp;amp;D team and help drive the growth of Wiz. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for developing and maintaining large-scale distributed components that power Wiz. We&#39;re looking for candidates who are passionate about tackling scaling challenges and take pride in writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code. Join us in our mission to secure the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our tech stack includes a multi-cloud architecture (Azure, AWS, GCP, OCI, Alibaba Cloud) with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, Kubernetes, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end development of backend software components (research, design, development, testing, rollout, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to technological and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting design and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing and improving efficiency, scalability, and stability of various backend system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams (e.g., Frontend, DevOps) to deliver top-tier features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Company You’ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carta is the connected platform and AI-native ecosystem for private capital. Built to replace fragmented tools with a single system of record, Carta brings together the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders use to manage equity, fund managers use to run administration and reporting, and legal teams use to close transactions. Trusted by 55,000 companies and 1.8M+ equity holders in 160+ countries, and 10,000 funds and SPVs representing $250B+ in assets under management, Carta is transforming how private capital operates. Recognized by Fortune, Forbes, Fast Company, Inc. and Great Places to Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about our offices and culture, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://carta.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Carta careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You’ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Finance Systems Administrator role will report to and work closely with the Finance Systems Senior Manager as well as partner with stakeholders across the Company in finance, accounting engineering, and business systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Problems You’ll Solve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carta, we&#39;re transforming how private capital operates — connecting the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders, fund managers, and legal teams depend on. We believe the problems we solve today unlock the opportunities of tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Finance Systems Developer role will proactively support the AI-driven development, implementation, and maintenance of Carta’s enterprise finance systems with a primary focus on NetSuite, Zuora, and related peripheral systems. This role will demonstrate strong influence and communications skills to collaborate internally with Finance, AP, AR and IT teams. The position will act as an advisor to the organization on system efficiency and effectiveness. The position will be the primary internal system admin and support contact for all finance systems in the Europe region including NetSuite, Zuora, Stripe, Zip, and others . This role will also collaborate with US counterparts to support the Middle East and APAC regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the adoption of AI, automation, and emerging technologies to transform accounting processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimate, design, implement, and maintain configurations and customizations of Finance Systems to meet the evolving needs of the finance team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal users and stakeholders, assisting with data analysis, business process mapping, reporting needs and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain proper system access for user roles ensuring compliance with segregation of duties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide internal, ongoing system/technical support to Finance users, including training with a focus on superior customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor end user usage of business systems and track performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide front line support with regards to all aspects of business facing applications and troubleshooting to diagnose, isolate and resolve issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, document and implement policies, procedures and guidelines to ensure data integrity, system integrity and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the change management and release process of NetSuite, Zuora, Stripe, and other finance applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide quality and timely communication regarding system status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date knowledge of system functionality, customization and integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding of additional business units and acquired subsidiaries onto Suite Billing, Zuora Billing and related quote-to-cash systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate for this position will demonstrate the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to integrate AI tools to optimize/redesign workflows and drive measurable impact (e.g., efficiency gains, quality improvements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing AI skill development (e.g., prompt/context engineering, Claude Plugin/Skills) and staying current with emerging AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Finance System administration, configuration, and third-party integrations in complex environments with a focus on NetSuite and Zuora&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with roles, permissions, page layouts, custom objects, SuiteScripts, workflows, reports, and dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL, CSV imports, user provisioning, role definitions, analytics, JavaScript(JS) and script scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in data analytics, reporting, and database management (SQL and NetSuite preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with revenue recognition principles and financial reporting concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of business processes&amp;nbsp; (O2C &amp;amp; P2P), system requirements, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the hire-to-retire process and system access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management, system implementation, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with minimal guidance while collaborating across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at managing multiple stakeholders and maintaining professionalism under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred but Not Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite and/or Zuora certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to providing a positive interview experience for every candidate. If accommodations due to a disability or medical condition are needed, please connect with the talent partner via email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carta uses E-Verify in the United States for employment authorization. See the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot;&gt;E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;Department&quot;&gt;Department of Justice&lt;/a&gt; websites for more details.&lt;/li&gt;
